00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:06.370
I'm Amano Ichigo, a 14 year old girl with no outstanding qualities.

00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:09.930
But that day, I met Henri-sensei.

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:11.970
And I found my dream.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:17.870
I don't know what to do, but I do know that I like to eat sweets.

00:02:17.870 --> 00:02:21.010
I know that my abilities are bad, but...

00:02:22.060 --> 00:02:25.010
After eating the cake Henri-sensei made, I began to dream.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.320
I also want to make that kind of sweets!

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:34.390
I want to become a full-fledged pâtissière!

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:41.040
I feel that there are less and less people...

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.540
Could it be that I boarded the wrong bus?

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:49.640
Next stop: St. Marie Academy district, St. Marie Academy district.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:51.480
Thank goodness, it seems I'm not mistaken.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:57.640
recipe 2

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:57.640
The Legendary Sweets Spirit?

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:03.020
Yeah right, like we've reached St. Marie Academy district...

00:03:03.020 --> 00:03:04.190
Liar.

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.820
Geez, where's the school?

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:10.640
Found it!

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:19.110
Awesome! So this is St. Marie Academy Japan boarding school!

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:22.100
As expected of a school that specifically teaches the making of pastry.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.970
It's bigger than what I saw on the handbook.

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:26.810
It's like a castle.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.210
Ah, there's a fountain.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.740
Could it be made of marble?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.510
To be able to learn to make pastry in this kind of place..

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.890
It's just like a dream.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.910
It'd be even better if Henri-sensei was here.

00:03:41.240 --> 00:03:44.100
To think that he has to transfer to France suddenly...

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:48.700
But if I work hard, I'm sure I'll be able to meet Henri-sensei again!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:49.790
I'll work hard.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.270
Eh? That is...

00:03:52.270 --> 00:03:53.880
Awesome. So pretty.

00:03:54.770 --> 00:03:58.320
Um, this is the queen of the Sweets Spirits.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:01.110
What are Sweets Spirits..?

00:04:01.110 --> 00:04:02.710
They're spirits of this school.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.540
It talked!

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:06.000
How can that be possible?

00:04:06.880 --> 00:04:10.020
People who sees the Sweets Spirits will have their dreams come true.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:13.240
That's how the legend goes in this school.

00:04:13.710 --> 00:04:15.440
Oh? That's interesting.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:22.180
Sweets Spirit-sama, I hope that I can become an outstanding pâtissière.

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:24.800
I hope that I can meet Henri-sensei earlier.

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:26.240
Amitabha...

00:04:26.550 --> 00:04:29.790
A-Amano-san, the statue isn't used for praying.

00:04:30.320 --> 00:04:32.490
Huh? How do you know my name?

00:04:33.070 --> 00:04:36.240
You're Amano Ichigo-san, the new transfer student, right?

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.010
I'm Katou Rumi.

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:40.650
I'm your roommate so I came to fetch you.

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.560
Pleased to meet you.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:44.120
Pleased to meet you too. You can just call me Ichigo.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.200
Come Ichigo-chan. First I'll lead you to your dorm.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.090
Hold on for awhile.

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:53.180
This is mini madeleine. Please eat it, okay?

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.620
A transfer student who doesn't follow the seasons, eh?

00:04:57.180 --> 00:04:58.710
This is the girls' dorm.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.440
And this is our room.

00:05:02.420 --> 00:05:03.860
It's cute!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.310
I placed the luggage that was sent from your home over there temporarily.

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:09.610
Thanks.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.300
If you need anything...

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.170
It's already this time!

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.540
Today is my turn to prepare the ingredients!

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.590
Ichigo-chan, go to the classroom first.

00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:18.180
Bye.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:19.530
R-Rumi-san!

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.720
Um, the classrooms...

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.670
Amano Ichigo-san.

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:34.140
He looks just like a girl, what a pretty person.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.800
How do you do?

00:05:35.800 --> 00:05:37.520
I'm second year Class A, Hanabusa.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:40.130
Second year... That means we're the same age.

00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.540
We're in the same class as well.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.680
For our friendship I'll give you a present.

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:47.480
Thank you.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.310
What a sweet smell.

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:53.720
Could it be that these roses are Sweets Crafts?

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.560
Yes, because it grew at my home.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:00.420
It makes me remember that it's the beautiful Royal Highness favourite.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:03.000
And so, I based it on that and made the roses.

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.510
Made? This was made by you?

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:06.850
That's right.

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:10.790
Awesome. Is he really the same age as me?

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:17.250
Ichigo-san has been recommended by Henri-sensei, right?

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:18.120
That's awesome.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.040
I don't think that.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:22.770
He can be called a genius pâtissier.

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:26.770
Genius? Yes, he's just like a genius.

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.280
Please hold my hand, Milady.

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:34.780
You don't have to, and it's not like I'm a Milady.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.540
No need to be polite, here.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.690
Really, I'm fine.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:39.300
Hey!

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:42.020
You're blocking my way.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.120
Ah, sorry.

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:47.490
This is a chocolate sculpture. It's a chocolate sculpture, isn't it?

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:49.140
Awesome!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.660
Who are you?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:54.860
Transfer student Amano-san.

00:06:54.860 --> 00:06:57.240
Amano-san, these two are also from our class.

00:06:57.580 --> 00:06:59.010
Kashino and Andou.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.930
I'm Amano Ichigo. Pleased to meet you.

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:04.760
Rather than introducing yourself, step aside. I can't get through.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:06.600
Sorry.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:12.770
I'm sorry. He's kinda shy.

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:15.080
How shy can he be?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:19.610
I know I'm the one at fault, but there should be a better way to say it.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.960
Amano-san. Here, open you mouth.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.290
Delicious!

00:07:26.970 --> 00:07:30.830
It's the maccha caramel that I made.
Pleased to meet you, Amano-san.

00:07:31.940 --> 00:07:33.020
We should get moving too.

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.750
You know, Hanabusa-kun. The one that made the chocolate sculpture...

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:39.560
Kashino.

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:44.240
It feels that these three are very professional, aren't they?

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:48.260
This school, could it be that it has unbelievable standards?

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.380
Sigh, this is horrible.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:52.400
It does, right?

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.350
Thank you.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:57.940
I'm the transfer student Amano Ichigo. Pleased to meet you.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:03.550
Hey hey, Amano-san. Why did you come in together with the three of them?

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.520
Eh? I met them at the corridor.

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:08.190
That's Sweets Crafts made by Hanabusa-kun, right?

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:10.560
You got them. How nice.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:14.370
To be able to be escorted by the Sweets Princes. We envy you.

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.790
Sweets Princes?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:17.680
It's those three.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:21.010
The one who can make pretty cakes, Hanabusa Satsuki-kun.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:24.020
Good at making chocolate cakes, Kashino Makoto-kun.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:27.690
Full of japanese aura, Andou Sennosuke-kun.

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.650
Those three are handsome and have the highest grades in the class.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.390
They're called "Sweets Princes".

00:08:34.930 --> 00:08:37.400
Those three really are an awesome bunch.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:43.440
So this is a pâtissière's clothes.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.160
It's the same as Henri-sensei.

00:08:46.970 --> 00:08:48.370
Amano-san, hurry up.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.630
Y-Yeah...

00:08:57.450 --> 00:08:59.590
T-This is a cooking room.

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.570
It's too amazing.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:06.720
That girl, I wonder how good she is at baking cakes?

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:10.440
Amano-san, I'll have you join the A-group.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:11.440
Yes.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.500
You serious?

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.830
That's amazing, Ichigo-chan!

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:17.410
A-group and the Sweets Princes are together.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:19.180
The group's results are top of the class.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:21.030
You're kidding. Why am I joining them!?

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:23.540
So it's the same as that time.

00:09:23.760 --> 00:09:26.400
She already joins the elite group when she just transferred.

00:09:26.400 --> 00:09:30.100
She has the recommendation of Henri-sensei.
She must have amazing skills.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.850
I've have to say, it's vexing.

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:34.530
To be able to always be together with Sweets Princes.

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Most Important Tools

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Crêpe Pan

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Ladle

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Cake Cooler

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Palette Knife

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Whipper

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:40.140
Chinoise

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.960
Today's lesson is on Mille crêpe.

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.150
Mille in French means a thousand.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:46.070
After spreading cream on the fried pancake and folding it multiple times...

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:47.450
Mille crêpe...

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:47.450
That's how you make it.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:49.980
I haven't made it before. What should I do?

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.680
Well then, please begin.

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.180
But I have to do my best.

00:09:57.760 --> 00:10:00.210
Eh? Why is everyone looking at me?

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.650
Ichigo-chan, do your best.

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:03.570
Y-Yes!

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:04.910
Umm...

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.180
I have to do my best.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.920
The egg...

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:09.710
What a waste.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.180
What are you doing?

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:15.630
It's really embarassing to make a mistake in this situation...

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.230
Don't be nervous, Ichigo-chan.

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.660
There are still a lot of eggs that can replace that one.

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.630
Calm down and try it again.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:25.400
Hanabusa-kun, Andou-kun...

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.640
Thanks.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.630
You two, don't go easy on her.

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:33.560
If someone does something weird, the whole group will be punished together for it.

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.650
I don't want to be dragged down.

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:36.980
I'm sorry.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.820
If you want to apologise, you should make a better pastry.

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.130
What's with him being so proud!?

00:10:42.130 --> 00:10:44.360
How about minding your own business!

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.860
Everyone has such smooth movements.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:05.900
Just like Henri-sensei...

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:10.890
Kashino's Mille crêpe is done.

00:11:11.350 --> 00:11:12.520
You're fast...

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.540
Beautiful.

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.410
Looks delicious.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.210
There is nothing to criticize about the shape and the taste of it.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:19.840
It's flawless, Kashino-kun.

00:11:19.840 --> 00:11:21.880
You'll be able to open up a shop soon.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:23.850
I'm done.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:24.440
It's completed.

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:28.150
Andou-kun, Hanabusa-kun have passed.

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:30.170
Have Amano-san finished too?

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:31.320
Somehow...

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.790
You're not kidding me, right?

00:11:36.720 --> 00:11:38.010
I'm sorry.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.210
There really is a big difference.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.230
A-group, minus 10 points.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:53.500
What's happening? Was she really recommended by Henri-sensei?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:55.270
She's not qualified to join the A-group, is she?

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:01.980
Umm, I've never made Mille crêpe before.

00:12:03.980 --> 00:12:05.360
More like...

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.050
I...

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.210
I'm a beginner in pastry making!

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:14.460
Ichigo-chan.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.300
Geez...

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.480
It certainly has a beginner's taste.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:49.660
Amano, it should now be ten days since you've received the school enrollment notice.

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.030
Yeah.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:55.370
You're a year behind us, so didn't you think of practicing beforehand?

00:12:55.840 --> 00:13:00.560
Perhaps you think of yourself as an idiot, hoping that someone else will teach you personally?

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:01.590
That's not...

00:13:01.590 --> 00:13:04.860
You're naïve! Our aim is to become professionals!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.880
If you don't have the determination, then go back home!

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:20.310
Hey, did you see Ichigo-chan?

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:21.880
No, I didn't.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.670
Not here?

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:24.020
I couldn't find her in her room.

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:25.970
Where did she go?

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.630
The first day for a transfer student. That was really harsh.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:32.880
I pity her. I wonder if she's hiding somewhere and crying?

00:13:32.880 --> 00:13:35.030
Kashino, you're going a bit too far.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:19.410
Ow, it's hot.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.270
Why does it turn out like this!?

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.420
This time, for sure..!

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.500
Ah, I put too much of it.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.010
The egg is full of air bubbles...

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:31.920
You came back.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.460
It's vexing, that Kashino.

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:36.820
He doesn't have to say it so harshly.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.110
It's hot....

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.030
Just wait...

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.970
She's even practicing by herself.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:45.900
I'll make Mille crêpe properly in a day to show you!

00:14:46.640 --> 00:14:49.300
It's burnt again.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:15:00.040
This way, I won't be able to face Henri-sensei.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.080
I finally got into this academy and all...

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:06.650
Sweets Spirit.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:10.760
People who sees the Sweets Spirits will have their dreams come true.

00:15:11.000 --> 00:15:14.290
Sweets Spirit-san. If you're there, please show yourself.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:17.540
I want to make delicious sweets.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:20.350
I want to become a pâtissière just like grandma.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:21.970
Make my dream come true!

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:30.690
That's right. How can there be a Sweets Spirit?

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.200
Do you really want to make them well?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.020
Could it be...

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.810
The spoon is flying!

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:45.000
It hurts....

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.710
Landing failed.

00:15:49.710 --> 00:15:54.130
Bonjour, Ichigo. I'm a Sweets Spirit, named Vanilla.

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.640
Sweets Spirit?

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:56.380
Oui.

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:58.890
You're kidding. You can't be this small.

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.630
It hurts!

00:16:01.070 --> 00:16:03.180
That's rude, Amano Ichigo.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:06.420
Although I'm small, my sweets making skills are awesome.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.920
Oh.. sorry.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.990
Umm, can you make my dream come true?

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:15.210
Oui, it is to make delicious sweets, right?

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:16.930
Yay!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:18.430
First get the crêpe pan.

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:19.050
Okay.

00:16:19.050 --> 00:16:19.940
Light up the flame.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:20.510
Yes.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.750
Put in the butter.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:23.420
Yes.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.900
With this it's completed, I'll be able to get a pretty crêpe.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.070
It's completely bad. Remake it!

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:37.600
Umm, shouldn't you be granting my dream?

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:42.230
Yes. In order for you to make delicious
sweets, Vanilla will give you lessons.

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:45.220
Lessons? Won't it work immediately?

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:47.930
As if there is such things in this world.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.440
There's only practice.

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:50.830
Quickly, one more time.

00:16:50.830 --> 00:16:51.800
But...

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:53.490
Stop wasting time and hurry up and do it!

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:54.810
Y-Yes.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:55.860
Hold on for a moment.

00:16:59.890 --> 00:17:02.080
The ingredients are fine. Next will be the frying method.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:05.870
Ichigo-chan...

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:08.170
Okay. Now you put in the ingredients.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:08.710
Yes.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:12.000
Don't rush in frying the crêpe, you have to do it properly.

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:15.090
Pour it out quickly!

00:17:15.090 --> 00:17:15.560
Yes!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:17.790
You burnt the cake!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:20.530
It has to be soft then it will be delicious.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:22.680
Ahh, it's burnt again.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:23.910
Hot...

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:27.790
Are you really listening to Vanilla's instructions!?

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:30.450
I'm sorry!

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.120
How many times do I have to say it!?

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:35.000
After frying a piece, you have to lower the temperature of the pan.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:35.910
Yes!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.930
No, no, no! You'll burn it.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.100
Hot!

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:42.000
Have more courage! You'll never be able to fry them properly if you don't.

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:43.490
My head is spinning.

00:17:46.550 --> 00:17:48.370
Ichigo, this one is well-made.

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:49.930
Really?

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:51.160
Très bien.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:53.030
I see, so it's this kind of feeling.

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:00.980
I can make it properly after practicing.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:06.840
You're doing good, Ichigo.

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:10.560
So if I practice, I'll be able to do it.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:12.930
Didn't you think of practicing beforehand?

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.220
Kashino's right.

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.300
Ichigo, is something wrong?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.150
No, it's nothing.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:20.780
I'm happy after I remember I found my victory.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:24.120
That's right. Sweets must be made with happy feelings.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.650
Yeah. You're right.

00:18:26.650 --> 00:18:28.790
After all, people love sweets.

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:33.500
It must be made to convey the happiness I wish for them. That makes the work rewarding.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:38.310
It's done! It came out to be so beautiful.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.320
It's all thanks to Vanilla.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:41.200
Thank you!

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.620
What are you doing?

00:18:52.680 --> 00:18:54.790
What was that card just now?

00:18:54.790 --> 00:18:57.240
Sweets that are made together with humans...

00:18:57.240 --> 00:19:02.100
...have to be changed into a recipe card
and given to the Sweets Spirits Queen.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.150
Next will be the decoration.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.660
It's cute. It looks like pearls now.

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:12.380
Vanilla's magic is Sweets Magic.

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.220
Magic...

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:16.630
What are Sweets Spirits?

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:18.240
Why did you come and save me?

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:22.750
Sweets Spirits are born to make delicious sweets.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:25.350
Through we always live in the Kingdom of Sweets,

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:29.300
when someone needs help, we'll come to the human world on the pretext of work.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:30.620
Work?

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:34.820
We work together with humans to make the best sweets.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:39.510
After it's recognized, we can become the kingdom's royal pâtissière.

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:43.230
Pâtissière? Is Vanilla aiming to be pâtissière as well?

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:45.440
Yes, it's Vanilla's dream.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:48.770
But, I have had troubles in finding a partner.

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:50.320
But I finally found Ichigo.

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.450
Me? You want me to be your partner?

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:54.140
Oui.

00:19:57.570 --> 00:19:59.380
That's the one from this morning.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.400
Yes. After that time, I kept watching you.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:07.010
That's why I understand that Ichigo loves sweets and is very hardworking.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:10.590
After being reprimanded by the strict Kashino, I thought you'd run away.

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:11.810
But you came back after all.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:16.010
So, let's make the best sweets together.

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:19.030
But I'm lousy at it.

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.160
I know that.

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.310
Then why?

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:24.530
There are many people who are better than me.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.380
There is no one who can make them properly at the start.

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:30.010
If you practice like today, you'll surely be able to make them.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:31.870
Let's do our best together!

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:33.720
Vanilla...

00:20:34.970 --> 00:20:38.980
You're right. It's alright to do it slowly.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:43.730
Although I still can't do it as well like Henri-sensei or Kashino and the others,

00:20:43.730 --> 00:20:47.550
I'll advance slowly just like I did with the Mille crêpe.

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:51.100
Because my dream has just began.

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:53.390
Vanilla, let's do our best together.

00:20:53.390 --> 00:20:54.100
Please take care of me.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:56.050
Oui, me too.

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:57.790
Let's party with Mille crêpe.

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.810
Yes!

00:20:58.810 --> 00:20:59.880
Delicious!

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:01.240
I might be a genius.

00:21:01.240 --> 00:21:03.240
It's because of Vanilla's lessons.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.400
Don't get too conceited.

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:06.330
Ichigo, Seconds, please.

00:21:06.330 --> 00:21:06.930
Coming.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.850
No, no, it's too small.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.940
Henri-sensei, how are you doing?

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:12.370
Cut it even bigger!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:15.950
I'm doing fine. I've made many unusual friends in St. Marie Academy.

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:19.340
We'll do our best and aim to become pâtissières together!

