00:23:08.200 --> 00:23:12.070
Aoki Sadaharu-san is the one who chooses the sweets in the show.

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.570
He's a well-known pâtissier even in France, the kingdom of sweets.

00:23:16.340 --> 00:23:19.480
Paris have many fabulous sweet shops.

00:23:22.350 --> 00:23:24.590
This is Aoki-san's shop!

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:28.120
Wow, it looks delicious.

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:34.030
What kind of feelings does Aoki-san have when he makes sweets, I wonder?

00:23:34.830 --> 00:23:39.300
Speaking of sweets, even if the languages differ,

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:44.930
sweets is a happiness that doesn't require languages, uses pastry to make people happy.

00:23:45.320 --> 00:23:49.230
Then I think it's great to be able to make sweets.

00:23:49.830 --> 00:23:52.920
Sweets bring happiness to everyone.

00:23:54.880 --> 00:23:59.940
Next time we will have pâtissiere Watanabe-san from Aoki-san's shop to teach us how to make sweets.

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:04.820
Does St. Marie Academy have normal lessons?

00:24:04.820 --> 00:24:09.230
I can't succeed in learning how to make sweets. Anything I make is a failure.

00:24:09.230 --> 00:24:11.850
Why did I transfer to this school?

00:24:11.850 --> 00:24:15.590
My friends from my old school, and my parents, I want to meet them!

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:19.500
The one who gave me that encouragement is my new friend,

00:24:19.500 --> 00:24:22.670
and he's one of the sweets princes, Hanabusa-kun.

